# Run output. Traces are reproducible from a seed, so an unshrunk one is noise;
# a *shrunk* one is a committed reproducer and belongs in the repository. Keep
# those under tests/reproducers/, which is deliberately not ignored here.
/traces
*.trace.jsonl
junit.xml

